# Only the three projects belong in this repository; everything else in this
# folder (Android SDK/JDK/Gradle, portable git/gh, editor settings) stays local.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/sitrep/
!/sitrep-android/
!/sitrep-ulm/
!/.github/

# Personal values (API token, home/work stops, medication defaults).
# Each project ships a local_config.example.json to copy from.
**/local_config.json

# Build output and local machine paths
**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/dist/
**/__pycache__/
**/local.properties
*.apk
*.aab
.idea/
*.iml

# Agent working notes and device screenshots
**/CLAUDE.md
*.png
